    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>• string</td>
        <td><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Parameters/name" target="_blank">name</a></td>
        <td>–</td>
        <td>The key of the linkset <b>name:value</b> pair to be read.The <b>key</b> of the <b>name:value</b> pair to be read.</td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
