        <td>–</td>
        <td>The pass phrase protecting the <b>name:value</b> pair.</td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <p>Caveats</p>
  <p>If the <b>pass</b> parameter does not match, this function returns an empty string.</p>
